# scenes/reunion.unmei — scene id: reunion
# Evening at the same gate. Opened via `jump reunion` from first_meeting.

bg school_gate
play music_evening

Narrator: The gate again, hours later. She's still there.

sprite ace neutral
decide ace.greet -> reply

label reply.warm
sprite ace happy
Ace: You came back! I... hoped you would.
jump end_reunion

label reply.cold
sprite ace neutral
Ace: Oh. It's you.
jump end_reunion

label reply.none
sprite ace neutral
Narrator: Ace watches you approach, unreadable.
jump end_reunion

label end_reunion
stop music_evening
jump epilogue
